{{#> layout}}
<p class="eyebrow">RECOVERY TOOL</p>
<h1>Recover a phonetic backup</h1>
<p>Enter the lines from your paper backup to recover its checksum and hex. Input stays on this page and is not sent or saved. Words are case-sensitive. Use the exact word list from your backup. Spaces are normalized before checking the word list.</p>
{{#> important-callout}}
ONLY USE THIS ON A SECURE OFFLINE DEVICE.
{{/important-callout}}
<form id="phonetic-form" class="phonetic-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
  <div class="phonetic-field">
    <label for="backup-checksum">Backup checksum</label>
    <input id="backup-checksum" placeholder="1234abcd=" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off">
    <p class="field-error"></p>
  </div>
  <p>Each data row has four words and a checksum word. Add or remove rows to match your paper.</p>
  <div id="word-rows"></div>
  <div class="phonetic-actions">
    <button type="button" id="add-row">Add row</button>
    <button type="button" id="remove-row">Remove last row</button>
  </div>
  <div class="phonetic-field">
    <label for="final-checksum">Final checksum · five digit words</label>
    <input id="final-checksum" placeholder="ZERO SIX FIVE FOUR EIGHT" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off">
    <div class="word-suggestions" hidden></div>
    <p class="field-error"></p>
  </div>
  <button type="submit">Validate and recover hex</button>
  <p id="recovery-error" class="field-error"></p>
  <div id="recovery-result" hidden>
    <label for="recovered-hex">Recovered checksum=hex</label>
    <textarea id="recovered-hex" readonly rows="3" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
    <br/><br/>
    <h2>Recover the private descriptors</h2>
    <p>Run this command, then paste the full recovered string above, including the <code>checksum=</code> prefix. Press Enter, then Ctrl-D to submit it. This will reveal the private descriptors that can be imported into Bitcoin Core.</p>
    {{#> important-callout}}
You need to have the decrypted key files, for more information read the <a href="../recover-from-backup/recovery/index.html">recovery guide</a>.
{{/important-callout}}
    {{#> code-block}}
python3 python/decrypt-secret-one-time-pad.py inheritance-multi-sig-keys | python3 python/restore-descriptor-xprv.py inheritance-multi-sig-keys
    {{/code-block}}
  </div>
</form>
<noscript>This recovery tool needs JavaScript enabled. You can also use the Python recovery scripts.</noscript>
<script src="../assets/phonetic-recovery.js" defer></script>
{{/layout}}
